      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965",
        "PMC7866258::chunk::001::introduction::03a7cc91e7"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "As-cast HfMoTaTiZr has a density of 10.21 g/cm³.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "As-cast HfMoTaTiZr has a room-temperature yield strength of approximately 1600 MPa.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "As-cast HfMoTaTiZr has a yield strength of approximately 855 MPa at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-to-V substitution will retain solid-solution strengthening and lattice-distortion effects.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V will integrate into the HfMoTaTiZr matrix similarly to Hf and preserve the key microstructural features.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V is lighter than Hf.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing heavy Hf with lighter V will lower the alloy's mass and density.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-containing NbMoTaWV alloy exhibits strong high-temperature mechanical performance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965",
        "PMC7866258::chunk::001::introduction::03a7cc91e7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "V addition has been reported to increase hardness and yield strength in earlier refractory high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::chunk::001::introduction::03a7cc91e7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The beneficial high-temperature role of V in NbMoTaWV can be transferred to HfMoTaTiZr without drastically disturbing its strengthening mechanisms.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::chunk::001::introduction::a6c9e13965",
        "PMC7866258::chunk::001::introduction::03a7cc91e7"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloys will have densities of approximately 9.2–9.7 g/cm³ or lower.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloys will retain room-temperature yield strength within ±10% of 1600 MPa and 1000 °C yield strength within ±10% of 855 MPa.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
